# CT University CO-PO Academic Management System

## Implementation Plan

Implement the university-wide academic hierarchy and reusable student management system in controlled phases.

IMPORTANT:

Do not implement everything in one uncontrolled change.

Follow the phases in order.

After each phase:

1. Verify the implementation.
2. Run the application.
3. Test existing functionality.
4. Check for regressions.
5. Only then continue to the next phase.

Do NOT commit changes automatically.

