# CORE PRINCIPLE

The system should no longer think:

"Which students are inside this Excel file?"

It should think:

"Which students belong to this University's academic class?"

Then:

"Which of those students are enrolled in this course?"

Then:

"What marks do those students have?"

Then:

"What is their CO/PO attainment?"

This is the foundation required for a scalable university-wide CO-PO academic management platform.
